{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "seed|2960872|18",
      "text": "電梯間排了好長的隊，聽說中間幾層在做維護",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776523493,
      "expires_at": 1776527093
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960875|23",
      "text": "十一樓健身區新添了幾件器材，是用富態化木材做的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776525168,
      "expires_at": 1776528768
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960874|3",
      "text": "有住戶說家裡石板縫長出了新的發光菌絲，紫綠色的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776524775,
      "expires_at": 1776528375
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960875|22",
      "text": "三樓醫療區最近比較忙，好像是採集隊回城的季節",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776525019,
      "expires_at": 1776528619
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960871|4",
      "text": "十六樓商區的地面接縫處冒出了細細的礦脈紋路",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776522931,
      "expires_at": 1776526531
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960874|1",
      "text": "五樓那戶陽台的根鬚盤得更緊了，看著倒是挺穩的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776524809,
      "expires_at": 1776528409
    },
    {
      "id": "eco|pulse|408",
      "text": "這幾天米鹽又貴了一點，街坊都在精打細算。",
      "source": "economy",
      "source_score": 1,
      "weight": 6,
      "updated_at": 1776525168,
      "expires_at": 1776530568
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960873|2",
      "text": "樓梯間的菌絲光昨晚特別亮，是琥珀色的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776524079,
      "expires_at": 1776527679
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960874|6",
      "text": "市集今天來了一批品相很好的玉質木材，攤販搶著進貨",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776524679,
      "expires_at": 1776528279
    }
  ]
}